+# Working on pantry
+
+pantry keeps a household's list of food and when each item is best before.
+
+## Rules
+
+- Only `src/store.mjs` touches the file system: every other module gets its items, and gives them back, through `load` and `save`, and never imports `node:fs`.
+- `load` validates a pantry file where it enters: every item has a `name` and a `bestBefore` date.
+- Tests use `node:test` and `node:assert`, and plain data instead of files.
