+# pantry
+
+A household's list of food, and when each item is best before.
+
+A pantry file is JSON: a list of `{ "name": "milk", "bestBefore": "2026-05-04" }`. It can live in a shared folder, such as one a household syncs between its members, so everyone adds to one list.
+
+```sh
+node src/cli.mjs add <file> <name> <best-before>
+node src/cli.mjs list <file>
+```
